& [Threats]
  + digest accepts changed raw bytes duplicate fields trailing JSON unknown fields reordered checks or widened bounds
  + plan path escapes its future root or argument text becomes an executable shell command
  + operation mutation dependency cycle grant insertion or unresolved removal converts declaration into implied authority
  + package manifest omits an input or remote target collides with protected state
  + compiler output varies by time environment host inspection or process lifetime
  + performance language promotes plan compilation timing into source-build or productivity claims

& [Controls]
  + strict canonical parse reserialization self digests exact enumerations path containment atom grammar deterministic derivation independent recompilation and byte equality
  + absent-root stage-and-rename install exact manifest before-after protected/provider audits fresh processes zero persistence and bounded error records

& [ResidualRisk]
  + this plan cannot prove the later source archive exists the toolchain is compatible or the physical build will pass
  + later execution requires new authority capacity rollback and evidence contracts
